  "omitEmptyRule": "An optional property the caller did not set must be absent from the serialized request body, not present and empty. A HostCommissionSpec carrying only its five required properties must serialize to exactly those five keys: no \"networkPoolName\":\"\", no \"sshThumbprint\":\"\", no \"sslThumbprint\":\"\", no \"vvolStorageProtocolType\":\"\", and no null-valued keys. The same rule applies to TokenCreationSpec, whose apiKey and idToken are unused by this flow.",
